I1
sVWe receive and store certain types of information whenever you interact with the Service.
p10
I1
sVWe will use such information to fulfill your requests, provide the relevant service, or for anti-fraud purposes.
p11
I1
sVWe use your location details to give you free reading access at Smart Reading Zones and also notify you when you are at a Smart Reading Zone.
p12
I1
sVWhen you purchase a magazine/subscription on our website, we additionally collect your Address (with Pin Code) and Card details in certain scenarios.
p13
I1
sVThe Site collects usage information, such as the numbers and frequency of user visits to our website and its components, which magazines are added to the cart, which contests you\u2019ve participated in, which magazines and articles are accessed through the Service, and the length and time a user may spend reading those magazines and articles.
p14
I1
sVj. We also collect information about your purchases and activities on the Service, which we may use to present you with offers that we believe may be of interest to you.
p15
I1
sVWhen you create a Magzter account, we collect your Name, Email address, Mobile Number, Password and Gender (optional).
p16
I1
sVPersonal Information will only be shared by Company to provide or improve our products, services, and to contact you about our services; it will not be shared with third parties for their marketing purposes.
p17
I1
sVIf we learn that we have collected personal information from a child under age 16, we will delete that information as quickly as possible.
p18
I1
sVWe will also use usage information in order to ensure users adhere to our Terms of Use.
p19
I1
sVWhen you send gift cards or subscriptions, we may collect the information you provide about the gift recipients, including name and email address.
p20
I1
sVBy visiting any of the websites operated by the Company, and any sub-domains thereof, or using any of our mobile applications and other methods of content distribution (collectively, the \u201cService\u201d), you acknowledge that you accept the practices and policies outlined in this Policy, and you hereby consent that we will collect, use, and share your information in the following ways.
p21
I1
sVIf we make changes in the way we use Personal Information, we will notify you by posting an announcement on the Service.
p22
I1
sVPlease note that we don\u2019t store your card details and they are stored only by the payment gateway.
p23
I1
sVWhen you contact us, we collect your email address to provide services and answer your queries.
p24
I1
sVWe collect your location details when you use our \u2018Smart Reading\u2019 service.
p25
I1
sVCompany allows you to access the following information about you for the purpose of viewing, and in certain situations, updating that information: email address, name, location and marketing preferences.
p26
I1
sVFor instance, if you add a magazine to your cart and the payment fails due to some reason, we may send you an e-mail to complete the purchase with an alternate payment method.
p27
I1
sVWe use industry-standard Secure Socket Layer (SSL) software to encrypt your Personal Information during transmission.
p28
I1
sVAs part of this use of information, we may provide non-personally identifying, aggregate information to our Participating Publishers and other third parties about how our users, collectively, use the Service.
p29
I1
sVCompany automatically collects information on our server logs from your browser including your Internet Protocol (IP) address, the name and identity of your computer, mobile device and other devices, your operating system, browser type and version, CPU speed, connection speed, and locale information based on IP address.
